f you want IntelliJ terminal to use this every time

Create/edit:

C:\Users\<your-user>\.bashrc

and add:

export JAVA_HOME="/c/path/to/jdk-21"
export MAVEN_HOME="/c/path/to/apache-maven-3.9.x"
export PATH="$JAVA_HOME/bin:$MAVEN_HOME/bin:$PATH"

Then restart the IntelliJ terminal or run:

source ~/.bashrc

For your Spring Boot 4 migration, the key check is:

mvn -version
